    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447300/extras/b2b5064f9d139db9b9b85d1815ad1073.poster.avif?t=1708279353\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447300/extras/b2b5064f9d139db9b9b85d1815ad1073.webm?t=1708279353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447300/extras/b2b5064f9d139db9b9b85d1815ad1073.mp4?t=1708279353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447300/extras/ce33b3db425b880ddc3da159ca2f2f08.poster.avif?t=1708279353\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447300/extras/ce33b3db425b880ddc3da159ca2f2f08.webm?t=1708279353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447300/extras/ce33b3db425b880ddc3da159ca2f2f08.mp4?t=1708279353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i>AnarchyField: Infinite Euphoric Level Destruction</i> is a revolutionary game with a focus on destruction and physics. <i>AnarchyField</i> is a breath of fresh air in the modern gaming industry which lacks and even detests innovation. <br><br>You get to be a vehicle or a plane in a small city where you can destroy buildings. This is a shooter where all your dreams about destructible world come true. Only a handful of games would allow you to interact with a destructible world like <i>AnarchyField</i> does.<br><br>Now it even has multiplayer! What are you waiting for?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447300/extras/4a6931cef940d524d2dcf8843cde0ebe.poster.avif?t=1708279353\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447300/extras/4a6931cef940d524d2dcf8843cde0ebe.webm?t=1708279353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447300/extras/4a6931cef940d524d2dcf8843cde0ebe.mp4?t=1708279353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Current features </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A small destructible city<br></li><li> Jet fighters<br></li><li> Cars<br></li><li> Multiplayer<br></li><li> An early look into a sandbox destructible world.</li></ul><br><strong>Features coming soon </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Bigger city maps to destroy<br></li><li> More vehicles and content</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Jump in to support early access if you seek destruction.</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447300/extras/b2b5064f9d139db9b9b85d1815ad1073.poster.avif?t=1708279353\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447300/extras/b2b5064f9d139db9b9b85d1815ad1073.webm?t=1708279353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447300/extras/b2b5064f9d139db9b9b85d1815ad1073.mp4?t=1708279353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447300/extras/ce33b3db425b880ddc3da159ca2f2f08.poster.avif?t=1708279353\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447300/extras/ce33b3db425b880ddc3da159ca2f2f08.webm?t=1708279353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447300/extras/ce33b3db425b880ddc3da159ca2f2f08.mp4?t=1708279353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i>AnarchyField: Infinite Euphoric Level Destruction</i> is a revolutionary game with a focus on destruction and physics. <i>AnarchyField</i> is a breath of fresh air in the modern gaming industry which lacks and even detests innovation. <br><br>You get to be a vehicle or a plane in a small city where you can destroy buildings. This is a shooter where all your dreams about destructible world come true. Only a handful of games would allow you to interact with a destructible world like <i>AnarchyField</i> does.<br><br>Now it even has multiplayer! What are you waiting for?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447300/extras/4a6931cef940d524d2dcf8843cde0ebe.poster.avif?t=1708279353\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447300/extras/4a6931cef940d524d2dcf8843cde0ebe.webm?t=1708279353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447300/extras/4a6931cef940d524d2dcf8843cde0ebe.mp4?t=1708279353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Current features </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A small destructible city<br></li><li> Jet fighters<br></li><li> Cars<br></li><li> Multiplayer<br></li><li> An early look into a sandbox destructible world.</li></ul><br><strong>Features coming soon </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Bigger city maps to destroy<br></li><li> More vehicles and content</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Jump in to support early access if you seek destruction.</h2>",
